# =============================================================================
# Neotree Sample Maker -- .gitignore
# =============================================================================
# This repository contains CODE, REFERENCE DICTIONARIES and DOCUMENTATION only.
# Patient-level data and credentials must NEVER be committed.
# =============================================================================

# --- Operating system junk ---------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db

# --- R session / project files -----------------------------------------------
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.RData
.Ruserdata
*.Rproj
.Rproj.user/
.Renviron

# --- Pipeline run artifacts (regenerated on every run) -----------------------
outputs/
*.log

# --- Raw and processed patient data (NEVER COMMIT) ---------------------------
# Cleaning pipeline output copied in for processing. Ignore everything here
# except the guide explaining what belongs in the folder.
input/*
!input/README.md

# Per-request subsample outputs.
subsamples/*
!subsamples/.gitkeep

# NA-coded data extracts
*_na_coded.csv
*_na_coded.xlsx

# --- Credentials / secrets (NEVER COMMIT) ------------------------------------
# A mirror token belongs in a local copy of install_packages_mirror.r only --
# the committed copy must keep the YOUR_TOKEN_HERE placeholder.
.env
*.pem
*.key
secrets.*
